{"unit_id":"610la__dsh-notification-center#feature-1","repo":"610la/dsh-notification-center","commit":"eef53f19a263304ec46f6ff856aa5852ea9db5b5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH 通知中心 的功能「事件完成通知」：宿主收集对话结束、子代理与 Workflow 完成、后台任务结束和批准请求，再由浏览器端轮询并显示提醒。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:33-73","src/index.js:101-166","src/client.js:363-378"]}
{"unit_id":"610la__dsh-notification-center#feature-2","repo":"610la/dsh-notification-center","commit":"eef53f19a263304ec46f6ff856aa5852ea9db5b5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH 通知中心 的功能「按事件配置音效」：在通知中心设置中，可为每类事件单独开关通知或音效，并选择内置音调、自定义文件或 URL 和音量。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:672-770","src/client.js:831-889"]}
{"unit_id":"610la__dsh-notification-center#feature-3","repo":"610la/dsh-notification-center","commit":"eef53f19a263304ec46f6ff856aa5852ea9db5b5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH 通知中心 的功能「浏览器与桌面系统通知」：浏览器端使用 Notification API；检测到 Electron 或 Tauri 时，改为请求宿主通过 node-notifier 发送原生系统通知。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:255-285","src/index.js:169-198"]}
{"unit_id":"610la__dsh-notification-center#feature-4","repo":"610la/dsh-notification-center","commit":"eef53f19a263304ec46f6ff856aa5852ea9db5b5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH 通知中心 的功能「通知快捷菜单与事件记录」：输入栏左侧铃铛可快速开关通知、授权或发送测试通知；设置页显示最近事件并提供完整分类配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:582-655","src/client.js:900-929"]}
{"unit_id":"610la__dsh-notification-center#feature-5","repo":"610la/dsh-notification-center","commit":"eef53f19a263304ec46f6ff856aa5852ea9db5b5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH 通知中心 的功能「通知节流和停止原因设置」：可设完成类事件的冷却间隔；批准、报错、超长、阻塞和手动停止事件绕过冷却，停止原因可分别配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:317-361","src/client.js:828-889"]}
